{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運硬地滾球項目，港隊代表梁育榮在男子BC4級個人賽四強，以4:3險勝國家隊代表鄭遠森，晉身決賽。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n梁育榮首兩局之後領先2:0，第三局被鄭遠森取得3分反先，最後一局梁育榮取得2分奠定勝局晉級。決賽將與泰國球手爭金牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n另一名港隊代表楊曉林在女子BC2級個人賽四強，以7:2大勝馬來西亞代表，晉身決賽。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n兩場決賽分別於下午舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:33.737682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:02:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:50.265788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:50.265788+00:00","content_hash":"b7c0b0ef88d2f747d48a59f4026a23d7df8ead10432bcfed8df6623b75bd1d73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}